.KEY NAME/A,SIZE/A,FRAMES/A
; egui-aros glow probe: <FRAMES> continuously repainted frames at <SIZE>
FailAt 21
Protect RAM:ea/egui-aros-glow-probe +e
Stack 4000000
SetEnv EGUI_PROBE_REPORT RAM:ea/<NAME>.txt
SetEnv EGUI_PROBE_FRAMES <FRAMES>
SetEnv EGUI_PROBE_SIZE <SIZE>
RAM:ea/egui-aros-glow-probe >RAM:ea/<NAME>-stdout.txt
Echo $RC >RESULTS:<NAME>.rc
Copy RAM:ea/<NAME>.txt RESULTS:<NAME>-report.txt
Echo "<NAME> done" >RESULTS:<NAME>-done.txt
